{"source": "cues", "duration": 74.96, "audio": "voix-sfx.wav", "phrases": [{"id": "v01", "start": 0.63, "end": 2.85, "text": "Jacques connaît sa machine mieux que personne.", "file": "motion/work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-12T16-45-55-249-i56aux.wav", "clip_start": 0.6, "clip_end": 3.13}, {"id": "v02", "start": 3.697, "end": 5.767, "text": "Dans un an, il prend sa retraite.", "file": "motion/work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-12T16-45-59-273-q9uv6m.wav", "clip_start": 3.667, "clip_end": 5.807}, {"id": "v03", "start": 6.451, "end": 11.121, "text": "Et d'ici 2030, de vingt à trente pour cent des technologues partiront aussi.", "file": "motion/work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-12T16-46-04-946-gp84nm.wav", "clip_start": 6.421, "clip_end": 11.281}, {"id": "v04", "start": 11.849, "end": 14.519, "text": "Leur savoir-faire n'est écrit nulle part.", "file": "motion/work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-12T16-46-09-409-70a496.wav", "clip_start": 11.819, "clip_end": 14.809}, {"id": "v05", "start": 16.36, "end": 17.89, "text": "Voici Clip.", "file": "motion/work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-12T16-45-30-763-gv8a09.wav", "clip_start": 16.33, "clip_end": 18.02}, {"id": "v06", "start": 18.648, "end": 23.658, "text": "Filmez l'expert pendant qu'il explique. Clip enregistre tout, sur le téléphone.", "file": "motion/work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-12T16-46-15-327-hczt11.wav", "clip_start": 18.618, "clip_end": 23.928}, {"id": "v07", "start": 24.307, "end": 29.817, "text": "Ajoutez des photos, une note vocale, ou vos vieilles procédures en PDF et en Word.", "file": "motion/work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-12T16-46-33-940-6lwh5w.wav", "clip_start": 24.277, "clip_end": 30.047}, {"id": "v08", "start": 30.426, "end": 34.286, "text": "Puis, d'un seul bouton, l'IA rédige l'instruction de travail.", "file": "motion/work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-12T16-50-37-556-t9x88m.wav", "clip_start": 30.396, "clip_end": 34.506}, {"id": "v09", "start": 34.885, "end": 39.495, "text": "Une action par étape, le bon extrait vidéo, les mises en garde au bon moment.", "file": "motion/work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-12T16-46-47-906-u4bu4p.wav", "clip_start": 34.855, "clip_end": 39.665}, {"id": "v10", "start": 40.32, "end": 45.153, "text": "Retouchez d'un mot. Annotez d'un clic. Traduisez en quelques secondes.", "file": "motion/work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-12T16-46-54-464-4dgujg.wav", "clip_start": 40.263, "clip_end": 45.173}, {"id": "v11", "start": 45.533, "end": 51.173, "text": "Et vos anciennes instructions? Déposez-les par dizaines, elles ressortent modernisées.", "file": "motion/work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-12T16-51-35-565-71ly00.wav", "clip_start": 45.503, "clip_end": 51.283}, {"id": "v12", "start": 51.84, "end": 57.34, "text": "Faites-la approuver, puis déployez-la au poste, sur une tablette ou par code QR, sans compte.", "file": "motion/work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-12T16-47-15-500-5qeea6.wav", "clip_start": 51.68, "clip_end": 57.5}, {"id": "v13", "start": 58.028, "end": 62.998, "text": "L'opérateur suit chaque étape, l'écoute à voix haute, et signale ce qui n'est pas clair.", "file": "motion/work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-12T16-48-08-780-mvx0hn.wav", "clip_start": 57.848, "clip_end": 63.258}, {"id": "v14", "start": 63.884, "end": 66.174, "text": "Et d'un clic, elle s'exporte en PDF.", "file": "motion/work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-12T16-50-50-177-7ghtaq.wav", "clip_start": 63.854, "clip_end": 66.474}, {"id": "v15", "start": 67.2, "end": 71.63, "text": "Clip. Le savoir-faire de vos experts, au poste, en quelques minutes.", "file": "motion/work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-12T16-47-36-733-2gal1x.wav", "clip_start": 67.17, "clip_end": 71.85}, {"id": "v16", "start": 72.37, "end": 73.31, "text": "Demandez une démo.", "file": "motion/work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-12T16-47-40-616-ucxim4.wav", "clip_start": 72.34, "clip_end": 73.4}], "words": [[0.63, 0.95, "Jacques", "v01"], [0.95, 1.49, "connaît", "v01"], [1.49, 1.57, "sa", "v01"], [1.57, 1.95, "machine", "v01"], [1.95, 2.33, "mieux", "v01"], [2.33, 2.49, "q